          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Followers today</span><span class="info-stat-val">none: its last branch, the Punic religion of the western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mediterranean">Mediterranean</a>, survived in some places until the 4th century CE</span></div>
